  "migration_notes": "Orders v2 changes how an order's money, customer and payment state are represented. Float money caused rounding incidents, so money must now be integer minor units plus an ISO 4217 currency. Customer identity now requires a stable customer_id and display_name instead of a single customer_name string. The payment state PENDING was renamed to AWAITING_PAYMENT to avoid ambiguity. Consumers should ship tolerant readers that accept v1 and v2 simultaneously during rollout before cleaning up legacy code paths."
